<li id="main-traits_off-fake-fn-25-target"><p><Link to="/source/cheliax_empire_of_devils">Cheliax, Empire of Devils</Link> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 25" id="backlink-main-traits_off-fake-fn-25" data-hash-target to="main-traits_off-fake-fn-25">↩</InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 25" id="backlink-main-traits_off-fake-fn-25.2" data-hash-target to="main-traits_off-fake-fn-25.2">↩<sup>2</sup></InnerLink></p></li>
