<li id="main-traits_init-fake-fn-2-target"><p><Link to="/source/ultimate_campaign">Ultimate Campaign</Link> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 2" id="backlink-main-traits_init-fake-fn-2" data-hash-target to="main-traits_init-fake-fn-2">↩</InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 2" id="backlink-main-traits_init-fake-fn-2.2" data-hash-target to="main-traits_init-fake-fn-2.2">↩<sup>2</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 2" id="backlink-main-traits_init-fake-fn-2.3" data-hash-target to="main-traits_init-fake-fn-2.3">↩<sup>3</sup></InnerLink></p></li>
